    "summary": {
      "value": "Gain access to the Forbidden Monarch set. Your discards grant you strength."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered one or more Classes among <strong>Ace of Cards</strong> and <strong>Arcanist</strong>, and you must have acquired <strong>3 Skill Levels</strong> in the <strong>Magic Cards</strong> Skill.</p><hr><p>After you discard cards due to the <strong>Magic Cards</strong> Skill, if at least one of those cards is a <strong>joker</strong>, you may choose any number of <strong>non-joker</strong> cards in your <strong>discard pile</strong> and shuffle them into your <strong>deck</strong>.</p><p>You also add the following <strong>effect</strong> to your list of <strong>sets</strong>:</p><table style=\"height:34px;width:100%;border-width:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:27.9621%\"></col><col style=\"width:72.0379%\"></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Effect</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Set Requirements</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Forbidden Monarch</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><p><strong>4 cards</strong> of the <strong>same value</strong>, <strong>none</strong> of which is a <strong>joker</strong> + <strong>1 joker</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>You deal damage 777 damage to every enemy you can see; the type of this damage is <strong>light</strong> if <strong>【the common value of the 4 cards】</strong> is <strong>even</strong>, or <strong>dark</strong> if that value is <strong>odd</strong>.</p><p>If there is a <strong>joker</strong> in your <strong>discard pile</strong>, the damage dealt by this effect ignores Immunities and Resistances.</p><p></p>",
